s only.","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null},{"column":8,"value":"^I did some testing with a 90% success rate with the following: ","formatted":"^I did some testing with a 90% success rate with the following: ","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null}]},{"row":28,"cells":[{"column":6,"value":"^ Can someone confirm what route/chapter for","formatted":"^ Can someone confirm what route/chapter for","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null},{"column":7,"value":"Shield of Zephyrus also obtained via Trial in Part 3","formatted":"Shield of Zephyrus also obtained via Trial in Part 3","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null},{"column":8,"value":"[Monoceros - Angelica] [Ferghanan Horse - Enrietto] [Red Megonius - Paradise Fish] [Dark Pegasus - Ninokka] [Falicorn - Cocominj]","formatted":"[Monoceros - Angelica] [Ferghanan Horse - Enrietto] [Red Megonius - Paradise Fish] [Dark Pegasus - Ninokka] [Falicorn - Cocominj]","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null}]},{"row":29,"cells":[{"column":8,"value":"^I'll do more testing later on to see if its just the flavors but all those items are the rare drop from searches near the lures except the cocominj which is \"Delicacy\" flavored","formatted":"^I'll do more testing later on to see if its just the flavors but all those items are the rare drop from searches near the lures except the cocominj which is \"Delicacy\" flavored","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null}]},{"row":30,"cells":[{"column":4,"value":"Releasing a Mount you have enough Friendship with gives you a charm with its stats, and a weight equal to the sum of its stats","formatted":"Releasing a Mount you have enough Friendship with gives you a charm with its stats, and a weight equal to the sum of its stats","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null},{"column":6,"value":"ie Releasing a friendship 5 Wild Ornius gives a charm with Spd+2, Dex+3, and 5 Weight","formatted":"ie Releasing a friendship 5 Wild Ornius gives a charm with Spd+2, Dex+3, and 5 Weight","note":null,"form