":"White Ornius","formatted":"White Ornius","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A36 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null},{"column":7,"value":"Mount rng is rolled once when it spawns to determine the species and again when caught to determine skill. you can save before it spawns to reroll the species, and save after it spawns to reroll the skill. tested with Ferghanan Horses in Sunfall Path (same set of world actions = consistently the same species/ability)","formatted":"Mount rng is rolled once when it spawns to determine the species and again when caught to determine skill. you can save before it spawns to reroll the species, and save after it spawns to reroll the skill. tested with Ferghanan Horses in Sunfall Path (same set of world actions = consistently the same species/ability)","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null}]},{"row":37,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Healing","formatted":"Paired Healing","note":"After combat, restores a little (some) HP to unit","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"White Ornius, Monoceros","formatted":"White Ornius, Monoceros","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A37 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":38,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Bulk","formatted":"Paired Bulk","note":"Grants Bld+2 (+4).","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Meganius","formatted":"Meganius","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A38 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":39,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Protection","formatted":"Paired Protection","note":"Reduces damage to 70% (50%) when attacked with a critical.","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Red Meganius","formatted":"Red Meganius","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A39 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null},{"column":7,"value":"^ Adding that success of capture is determined once bait is placed from my testing. For example, if common bait placed and actions lead to correct species BUT fails to be captured. You can roll back to the save before bait was placed and upgrade the bait to a rarer bait or differnt bait and it can lead to succesful capture if repeating the same actions that spawned the specie. Even if it says bait is \"perfect\", you can still fail so try to save before bait is placed too just in case.\nAlso if correct species but wrong ability, waiting a turn or two+ can switch it to another ability if you can spare the turns (this was tested upon initial spawning; not sure if it is true when mount was spawned a long time before capturing)","formatted":"^ Adding that success of capture is determined once bait is placed from my testing. For example, if common bait placed and actions lead to correct species BUT fails to be captured. You can roll back to the save before bait was placed and upgrade the bait to a rarer bait or differnt bait and it can lead to succesful capture if repeating the same actions that spawned the specie. Even if it says bait is \"perfect\", you can still fail so try to save before bait is placed too just in case.\nAlso if correct species but wrong ability, waiting a turn or two+ can switch it to another ability if you can spare the turns (this was tested upon initial spawning; not sure if it is true when mount was spawned a long time before capturing)","note":null,"formula":null,"error":null}]},{"row":40,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Magic-Focus","formatted":"Paired Magic-Focus","note":"When equipped with magic, grants Hit+10 (+15).","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Magonius","formatted":"Magonius","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A40 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":41,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Magic-Sight","formatted":"Paired Magic-Sight","note":"When equipped with magic, grants Crit+5 (+10).","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Black Magonius","formatted":"Black Magonius","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A41 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":42,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Canto","formatted":"Canto","note":"After combat, unit can move up to 1 (2) space(s).","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Black Magonius, Ferghanan Horse, Black Horse, Falicorn, Black Bau","formatted":"Black Magonius, Ferghanan Horse, Black Horse, Falicorn, Black Bau","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A42 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":43,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Alertness","formatted":"Paired Alertness","note":"Grants Ddg+5 (+10).","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Wild Horse","formatted":"Wild Horse","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A43 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null}]},{"row":44,"cells":[{"column":1,"value":"Paired Arts-Focus","formatted":"Paired Arts-Focus","note":"Grants Hit+10 (+15) when attacking with a combat art.","formula":null,"error":null},{"column":2,"value":"Ferghanan Horse, Red Bau","formatted":"Ferghanan Horse, Red Bau","note":null,"formula":"=TEXTJOIN(\", \", TRUE, FILTER($A$3:$A$24, BYROW($B$3:$F$24, LAMBDA(r, COUNTIF(r, \"*\" & $A44 & \"*\") > 0))))","error":null},{"column":7,"value":"^ mount RNG (both spawning and determining ability) draws from the same seed as overworld RNG, so different kinds of actions change the result, eg. placing bait then waiting 5 times might spawn something different than placing bait and doing search 1 time → wait 4 times","formatted":"^ mount RNG (both spawning and determining ability) dr